    H_ERR_GOZERO --> H_ENABLE : 0xea start=1 and pc_authority and safety_mode == 30 and is_terminal (safety_seer_gate.h:558-566)
    H_ENABLE --> H_SETSPEED : unconditional, next 8 Hz tick (safety_seer_gate.h:587)
    H_SETSPEED --> H_START : unconditional, next tick (safety_seer_gate.h:594)
    H_START --> H_WAIT : unconditional, next tick + stage_reset (safety_seer_gate.h:602-603)
    H_WAIT --> H_RESTORE : done_mask == 0b11 (both steer nodes homed) (safety_seer_gate.h:630-632)
    H_WAIT --> H_ERR_TIMEOUT : elapsed_s >= SEER_HOME_TIMEOUT_S = 120 s -> cancel frames (safety_seer_gate.h:635-641)
    H_RESTORE --> H_GOZERO : unconditional, next tick (safety_seer_gate.h:654)
    H_GOZERO --> H_GOZERO_W : unconditional, next tick + stage_reset (safety_seer_gate.h:663-664)
    H_GOZERO_W --> H_DONE : reached_mask == 0b11 (safety_seer_gate.h:689-690)
    H_GOZERO_W --> H_ERR_GOZERO : elapsed_s >= SEER_HOME_ZERO_TMO_S = 30 s, no cancel frames sent (safety_seer_gate.h:693-700)
    H_ENABLE --> H_ERR_ABORT : !pc_authority or safety_mode != 30 -> cancel frames (safety_seer_gate.h:576-579), or 0xea start=0 (safety_seer_gate.h:550-551)
